standards.Maximum Number:
One per street frontage for premises less than three acres, but not to exceed three signs per premise; 
Two per street frontage for premises that are between three acres and ten acres, not to exceed four signs per premise; 
Three per street frontage for premises that are between ten acres and 20 acres, not to exceed six signs per premise; 
No more than six signs for premises between 20 acres and 40 acres; 
No more than eight signs for premises over 40 acres.
